      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "PINK TROMBONE / 4 VOICES\n\nPlay chords with the QWERTY / ZXCVB keyboard rows.\n\nDrag the tongue to shape vowels.\nDrag the tract to narrow it; release to restore. Shift-drag to hold.\n\nDrag the voicebox: X = pitch, Y = tenseness.\n\nEvery base control and CV amount is in the side panel. Geometry controls use the same aligned CV rows. Spread appears in polyphony.\n\nCV feedback shows voice 1. All 16 voices are independent."
      },
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
